{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">葵涌發生致命車禍，一名76歲婆婆遭垃圾車撞倒死亡。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.KC-1230.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026Fy3xfApLxN1787904651.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.KC-1230.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發在興寧路和興芳路交界，垃圾車在行人過路處前方停下，車頭損毀，車底壓著一部小型手推車，車上的紙箱變形。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方上午10時許接報，一名婆婆遭垃圾車撞倒，送院途中證實不治。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">34歲的貨車司機，涉嫌危險駕駛引致他人死亡被捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T08:21:42.451110+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}